                  rate-limit:{userId}:{window}
                </text>
                <rect
                  x="170"
                  y="225"
                  width="120"
                  height="50"
                  rx="10"
                  fill="#211d33"
                  stroke="#2dd4bf"
                />
                <text
                  x="230"
                  y="248"
                  fill="#2dd4bf"
                  text-anchor="middle"
                  data-pt="Handler"
                  data-en="Handler"
                >
                  Handler
                </text>
                <text
                  x="230"
                  y="264"
                  fill="#9ea2b8"
                  text-anchor="middle"
                  font-size="10"
                  data-pt="resto (P1/P2)"
                  data-en="rest (P1/P2)"
                >
                  resto (P1/P2)
                </text>
              </g>
              <g
                stroke="#8b6ff7"
                stroke-width="2"
                fill="none"
                marker-end="url(#m5)"
              >
                <path d="M110 105 H180" />
                <path d="M280 100 H430" />
                <path d="M430 122 H280" />
                <path d="M230 140 V225" />
              </g>
              <g
                stroke="#ef476f"
                stroke-width="2"
                fill="none"
                stroke-dasharray="4 4"
                marker-end="url(#m5r)"
              >
                <path d="M215 90 C215 40 130 30 95 90" />
              </g>
              <text
                x="145"
                y="97"
                font-family="Space Grotesk"
                font-size="11"
                fill="#9ea2b8"
                text-anchor="middle"
                data-pt="1. request"
                data-en="1. request"
              >
                1. request
              </text>
              <text
                x="355"
                y="92"
                font-family="Space Grotesk"
                font-size="11"
                fill="#9ea2b8"
                text-anchor="middle"
                data-pt="2. INCR + EXPIRE (Lua)"
                data-en="2. INCR + EXPIRE (Lua)"
              >
                2. INCR + EXPIRE (Lua)
              </text>
              <text
                x="355"
                y="140"
                font-family="Space Grotesk"
                font-size="11"
                fill="#9ea2b8"
                text-anchor="middle"
                data-pt="3. count"
                data-en="3. count"
              >
                3. count
              </text>
              <text
                x="155"
                y="30"
                font-family="Space Grotesk"
                font-size="11"
                fill="#fb7185"
                text-anchor="middle"
                data-pt="4. acima do limite → 429"
                data-en="4. over limit → 429"
              >
                4. acima do limite → 429
              </text>
              <text
                x="155"
                y="46"
                font-family="Space Grotesk"
                font-size="10"
                fill="#9ea2b8"
                text-anchor="middle"
              >
                Retry-After · RateLimit · RateLimit-Policy
              </text>
              <text
                x="242"
                y="185"
                font-family="Space Grotesk"
                font-size="11"
                fill="#9ea2b8"
                data-pt="5. abaixo do limite"
                data-en="5. under the limit"
              >
                5. abaixo do limite
              </text>
            </svg>`} />
  <ol slot="order">
    <Fragment set:html={`<li>`} />
    <T pt={`Cliente → API ×N`} en={`Client → API ×N`} />
    <Fragment set:html={`</li>
<li>`} />
    <T pt={`Redis à direita: "INCR + EXPIRE no 1º (Lua)", chave
    rate-limit:{userId}:{window}`} en={`Redis on the right: "INCR + EXPIRE on 1st (Lua)", key
    rate-limit:{userId}:{window}`} />
    <Fragment set:html={`</li>
<li>`} />
    <T pt={`Setas API ↔ Redis ("INCR + EXPIRE", volta "count") — o Redis
    conta; quem decide e responde 429 é a API`} en={`Arrows API ↔ Redis ("INCR + EXPIRE", back "count") — Redis
    counts; the API decides and answers the 429`} />
    <Fragment set:html={`</li>
<li>`} />
    <T pt={`Seta vermelha API → cliente: acima do limite → 429 (com
    Retry-After, RateLimit e RateLimit-Policy)`} en={`Red arrow API → client: over the limit → 429 (with Retry-After,
    RateLimit, and RateLimit-Policy)`} />
    <Fragment set:html={`</li>
<li>`} />
    <T pt={`Abaixo do limite → handler (o resto de P1/P2)`} en={`Under the limit → handler (the rest of P1/P2)`} />
    <Fragment set:html={`</li>`} />
  </ol>
  <Fragment slot="extra" set:html={`<h3>
          <span data-lang="pt">Três eras do INCR + EXPIRE</span
          ><span data-lang="en">Three eras of INCR + EXPIRE</span>
        </h3>
        <div class="table-wrap">
          <table>
            <thead>
              <tr>
                <th>
                  <span data-lang="pt">Versão</span
                  ><span data-lang="en">Version</span>
                </th>
                <th>
                  <span data-lang="pt">Comandos</span
                  ><span data-lang="en">Commands</span>
                </th>
                <th>
                  <span data-lang="pt">Como funciona</span
                  ><span data-lang="en">How it works</span>
                </th>
              </tr>
            </thead>
            <tbody>
              <tr>
                <td>
                  <span data-lang="pt">qualquer Redis</span
                  ><span data-lang="en">any Redis</span>
                </td>
                <td>
                  <code>local c = INCR k<br />if c == 1 then<br />&nbsp;&nbsp;EXPIRE k 60<br />end<br />return c</code>
                </td>
                <td>
                  <span data-lang="pt"
                    >Lua clássica: uma viagem só, atômica, portátil — é o que a
                    maioria das libs de rate limit roda por dentro. O
                    <code>if c == 1</code> garante que o EXPIRE roda uma única
                    vez, no nascimento da janela.</span
                  ><span data-lang="en"
                    >The classic Lua: one round trip, atomic, portable — what
                    most rate-limit libraries run internally. The
                    <code>if c == 1</code> ensures EXPIRE runs exactly once,
                    at the window's birth.</span
                  >
                </td>
              </tr>
              <tr>
                <td>Redis 7.0+</td>
                <td>
                  <code>MULTI<br />INCR k<br />EXPIRE k 60 NX<br />EXEC</code>
                </td>
                <td>
                  <span data-lang="pt"
                    >Sem script: o <code>NX</code> do EXPIRE (novo no 7.0) só
                    define o TTL se a chave ainda não tem — a transação
                    MULTI/EXEC substitui o Lua.</span
                  ><span data-lang="en"
                    >No script: EXPIRE's <code>NX</code> option (new in 7.0)
                    only sets the TTL if the key has none — the MULTI/EXEC
                    transaction replaces Lua.</span
                  >
                </td>
              </tr>
              <tr>
                <td>Redis 8.8+</td>
                <td><code>INCREX k BYINT 1 EX 60 ENX</code></td>
                <td>
                  <span data-lang="pt"
                    >Um único comando nativo: incrementa e aplica
                    <code>EX 60</code> com <code>ENX</code> — TTL apenas se a
                    chave não tem TTL. Responde
                    <code>[count, incremento aplicado]</code>; o count é o 1º
                    elemento. Recém-chegado (8.8) — ainda ausente no Redis
                    Cloud/Software.</span
                  ><span data-lang="en"
                    >A single native command: increments and applies
                    <code>EX 60</code> with <code>ENX</code> — TTL only if the
                    key has no TTL. Replies
                    <code>[count, increment applied]</code>; the count is the
                    1st element. Brand new (8.8) — not yet on Redis
                    Cloud/Software.</span
                  >
                </td>
              </tr>
            </tbody>
          </table>
        </div>
        <h3>
          <span data-lang="pt">A vida da chave (por que o “só no 1º” importa)</span
          ><span data-lang="en">The life of the key (why “only on the 1st” matters)</span>
        </h3>
        <div class="scroll-x" style="margin: 18px 0">
          <svg
            viewBox="0 0 720 168"
            width="100%"
            style="min-width: 620px"
            role="img"
            aria-labelledby="p5w"
          >
            <title
              id="p5w"
              data-pt="Janela fixa: o TTL nasce no 1º hit, não é renovado nos hits seguintes, e a chave expira em 60s; a próxima janela nasce no hit seguinte"
              data-en="Fixed window: the TTL is born on the 1st hit, is not refreshed by later hits, and the key expires at 60s; the next window is born on the following hit"
            >
              Janela fixa
            </title>
            <rect
              x="105"
              y="26"
              width="365"
              height="20"
              rx="10"
              fill="none"
              stroke="#2dd4bf"
              stroke-width="1.5"
            />
            <text
              x="287"
              y="40"
              fill="#2dd4bf"
              text-anchor="middle"
              font-family="Space Grotesk"
              font-size="10"
              font-weight="700"
              data-pt="janela fixa de 60s"
              data-en="fixed 60s window"
            >
              janela fixa de 60s
            </text>
            <line x1="40" y1="95" x2="685" y2="95" stroke="#3a3f55" stroke-width="2" />
            <line
              x1="470"
              y1="50"
              x2="470"
              y2="88"
              stroke="#ef476f"
              stroke-width="1.5"
              stroke-dasharray="4 4"
            />
            <circle cx="105" cy="95" r="6" fill="#2dd4bf" />
            <circle cx="300" cy="95" r="6" fill="#8b6ff7" />
            <circle cx="470" cy="95" r="6" fill="#ef476f" />
            <circle cx="620" cy="95" r="6" fill="#2dd4bf" />
            <g
              font-family="Space Grotesk"
              font-size="10"
              fill="#9ea2b8"
              text-anchor="middle"
            >
              <text x="105" y="78">t=0</text>
              <text x="300" y="78">t=1…59</text>
              <text x="470" y="78">t=60</text>
              <text x="620" y="78">t=61+</text>
            </g>
            <g font-family="Space Grotesk" font-size="11" text-anchor="middle">
              <text x="105" y="120" fill="#eceef6" font-weight="700" data-pt="1º hit" data-en="1st hit">1º hit</text>
              <text x="105" y="136" fill="#9ea2b8" data-pt="count=1 · TTL nasce" data-en="count=1 · TTL is born">count=1 · TTL nasce</text>
              <text x="300" y="120" fill="#eceef6" font-weight="700" data-pt="hits 2…N" data-en="hits 2…N">hits 2…N</text>
              <text x="300" y="136" fill="#9ea2b8" data-pt="count++ · TTL intacto" data-en="count++ · TTL untouched">count++ · TTL intacto</text>
              <text x="470" y="120" fill="#eceef6" font-weight="700" data-pt="chave expira" data-en="key expires">chave expira</text>
              <text x="470" y="136" fill="#9ea2b8" data-pt="contador some" data-en="counter is gone">contador some</text>
              <text x="620" y="120" fill="#eceef6" font-weight="700" data-pt="próximo hit" data-en="next hit">próximo hit</text>
              <text x="620" y="136" fill="#9ea2b8" data-pt="count=1 · nova janela" data-en="count=1 · new window">count=1 · nova janela</text>
            </g>
            <text
              x="360"
              y="160"
              font-family="Space Grotesk"
              font-size="10"
              fill="#9ea2b8"
              text-anchor="middle"
              data-pt="O EXPIRE roda uma só vez, no nascimento — rodar a cada hit viraria janela deslizante"
              data-en="EXPIRE runs once, at birth — running it on every hit would turn it into a sliding window"
            >
              O EXPIRE roda uma só vez, no nascimento — rodar a cada hit viraria janela deslizante
            </text>
          </svg>
        </div>`} />
  <p class="cite" slot="cite" set:html={`<a
  href="https://github.com/donnemartin/system-design-primer#rate-limiter"
  >System Design Primer — rate limiter</a
>`} />
</Pattern>
